target+=-((-log(p[1]))^a+(-log(p[2]))^a)^(1/a)-log(p[1])-log(p[2])+(-2+2/a)*log((-log(p[1]))^a+(-log(p[2]))^a)+(a-1)*log(log(p[1])*log(p[2]))+log1p((a-1)*((-log(p[1]))^a+(-log(p[2]))^a)^(-1/a));

  }
}

