an be replaced with

  comp_lpdf[k] = log_lambda[k] + normal_lpdf(y[n] | mu[k], 1);

3.  vectorize

>  for (k in 1:K)
>    mu[k] ~ normal(0, 5);

as

  mu ~ normal(0, 5);

